``` KV-01 | KV Store Status Across Every Member
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: Lookups backed by the KV Store return nothing, apps show KV
    Store errors, or the bulletin board says the KV Store is not ready; check
    status on every search head and flag any member not in ready.
    Run on: SH-local (or splunk_server=* across the SHC) for current state, SH
    for the history.
    Query: Main query
```
| rest splunk_server=* /services/kvstore/status count=0
| rename current.status as status,
         current.replicationStatus as replication_status,
         current.storageEngine as storage_engine,
         current.backupRestoreStatus as backup_restore,
         current.disabled as disabled,
         current.port as port
| eval healthy=if(status="ready", "yes", "NO")
| table splunk_server healthy status replication_status storage_engine port
        disabled backup_restore
| sort healthy splunk_server
